{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2023-01-27 14:15:00', 'title': "ZIONS BANCORPORATION'S BOARD APPROVES SHARE REPURCHASE AND DECLARES DIVIDENDS ON COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK", 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ZIONS BANCORPORATION, N.A. (NASDAQ: ZION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (“BOARD”) AUTHORIZED A SHARE REPURCHASE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023 OF UP TO $50 MILLION.'}